msgid "Choose \"Emoji\" and type one, or choose \"Icon\" and paste the class from an icon library your theme already loads — for example fa-solid fa-angle-right for Font Awesome. This plugin bundles no icon font; if nothing loads it, no icon shows and the sitemap is otherwise unaffected."
