msgstr "投稿を更新し、上の入力欄に同じフィールド名を入力します。"

#: assets/js/block.js:21 assets/js/block.js:53 assets/js/block.js:63 assets/js/block.js:71 assets/js/block.js:87 assets/js/block.js:93 assets/js/block.js:106 assets/js/block.js:112
msgid "Use the site default"
